# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ShiftSure — Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit .env or real credentials to version control.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── SAP AI Core / Generative AI Hub (Option 1 — preferred for SAP hackathon) ─
#
# All fields come from the SAP AI Core service key you download in BTP.
# In the BTP cockpit: Services → Instances → your AI Core instance → Service Keys.
# The downloaded JSON has the following mapping:
#
#   Service-key field                       →  Environment variable
#   ─────────────────────────────────────── ── ─────────────────────────────────
#   url                                     →  AICORE_AUTH_URL
#     (the "url" under "uaa" block, NOT the AI Core API url)
#   clientid                                →  AICORE_CLIENT_ID
#     (found under "uaa" block)
#   clientsecret                            →  AICORE_CLIENT_SECRET
#     (found under "uaa" block)
#   serviceurls.AI_API_URL                  →  AICORE_BASE_URL
#     (the root AI Core API endpoint, e.g. https://api.ai.prod.eu-central-1.aws.ml.hana.ondemand.com)
#
# Additional values you supply yourself after creating a deployment in AI Launchpad:
#   Your deployment ID (from AI Launchpad → Deployments) → AICORE_DEPLOYMENT_ID
#   Resource group name (usually "default")               → AICORE_RESOURCE_GROUP
#   Model name in the payload (e.g. "gpt-4o")             → AICORE_MODEL_NAME

AICORE_AUTH_URL=https://<your-tenant>.authentication.<region>.hana.ondemand.com
AICORE_CLIENT_ID=<clientid from uaa block>
AICORE_CLIENT_SECRET=<clientsecret from uaa block>
AICORE_BASE_URL=https://api.ai.<region>.ml.hana.ondemand.com
AICORE_DEPLOYMENT_ID=<your-deployment-id>
AICORE_RESOURCE_GROUP=default
AICORE_MODEL_NAME=gpt-4o

# ── OpenAI (Option 2 — secondary fallback, optional) ─────────────────────────
# Only used if AICORE_* vars are NOT set.

OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-ijklmnopqrstuvwxijklmnopqrstuvwxijklmnop

# ── Notes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If neither SAP nor OpenAI credentials are present, ShiftSure operates fully
# offline using deterministic templates.  The /api/health endpoint reports the
# active mode: "sap_genai_hub" | "openai" | "deterministic".

